[A random 128-bit number, made the first time you download from a registry, not when the game starts. Each registry that asks has its own. Core Prime asks for one. It is sent only when asking that registry for a download. Turning it off forgets it, and downloads from that registry stop. Built-in languages and files you open keep working.]
